      "hadithIndex": 2033,
      "bookHadithIndex": 139,
      "text": "Abu Sa'eed narrated that the Messenger of Allah (s.a.w) said:\"There is no forbearance except for the one who stumbled, and there is no wisdom except for the one who has experience.\" (Dai'f)",
