      "bookIndex": 27,
      "hadithIndex": 2035,
      "bookHadithIndex": 141,
      "text": "Usamah bin Zaid narrated that the Messenger of Allah (s.a.w) said:\"Whoever some good was done to him, and he says: 'May Allah reward you in goodness' then he has done the most that he can of praise",
